  "briefing": "The expert cutover. Fourteen drops on one split, the OLT running hot at +6 dBm, and a storm cell sitting over the feeder route. The NOC uplink is XGS at two kilometers \u2014 on a small split it will overload before the far units wake up. Hang the split that tames the hot ONT, drive the NBI bulk turn-up, and hold the plant together when the water gets in. Everything you've learned, one level.",
